IMPORT prelude

-- Row il-42. THE CROSS-REFERENCES OF THE ENCODED SECTIONS, as typed values.
-- A citation is encoded as TWO values: what the citing words say they point at, and what the target says it is. A test compares them. Where they differ, the citation does not point at what it says it
-- does; that would be a finding, kept in an expected-red file with its count declared in check.sh and encoding.json. None of the sixteen is one (section 11 of NOTES.md says how a seventeenth reading was retracted).
-- THE KINDS BELOW ARE MINE, not the Law's: each is a short plain description I wrote from reading the citing words and the target's heading or text, so that two descriptions of the same thing are the same
-- kind. The quoted lines beside each reference are the Law's words, expanded mechanically from the deposit; the tests only compare my two descriptions.
-- WHAT THIS DOES NOT DO. It covers the citations in the sections this row encodes (ss 15, 48A, 48B, 49 to 49F, and the ones those sections make into others); the citations inside the sections encoded as
-- context only (ss 17 to 24, 37 to 39A) and inside s 9 are not typed here. s 9 is listed in NOTES.md (fork register). Every finding is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY: the amending instruments were not read for these citations.

§ `Cross-references`

DECLARE `What a provision is about` IS ONE OF
    `a share of a dwelling of at most a third, or a half if inherited`
    `buying an alternative dwelling`
    `holding exactly one other dwelling`
    `selling the other dwelling free of tax within 12 months`
    `the Area, where the Law's taxes are imposed`
    `the additional exemption for building rights`
    `the bodies exempted by section 72 (the local authorities and the like)`
    `the deceased owning one dwelling only`
    `the definition of a dwelling`
    `the exemption of a qualifying dwelling`
    `the only-dwelling exemption`
    `the rate cap on an individual's real appreciation`
    `the seller's declaration to the Director`
    `the seller's relation to the deceased: spouse, descendant, or a descendant's spouse`
    `the treatment of the rest of the sale value as the sale of another right`

DECLARE `A cross-reference` HAS
    `the citing words are in` IS A STRING
    `the citing words say it points at` IS A `What a provision is about`
    `the target is` IS A `What a provision is about`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the citation points at what it says` MEANS c's `the citing words say it points at` EQUALS c's `the target is`

-- 49B(2) to 49C(3)
-- src:731 | (2) הדירה הנמכרת היא דירתו היחידה של המוכר בישראל ובאזור כהגדרתו בסעיף 16א, והמוכר הוא בעל הזכות בה במשך 18 חודשים לפחות מיום שהיתה לדירת מגורים, ולא מכר, במשך שמונה עשר החודשים שקדמו למכירה האמורה, דירת מגורים אחרת כאמור, בפטור ממס לפי פסקה זו; הוראה זו לא תחול על מכירת חלק בדירה כאמור בסעיף 49ג(3) ועל מכירת דירה שהושכרה למגורים בשכירות מוגנת לפני יום כ״ב בטבת התשנ״ז (1 בינואר 1997) אם בשל החלק או הדירה האמורים הוחלה החזקה שבסעיף 49ג במכירת דירת מגורים אחרת בפטור ממס לפי פסקה זו;
